IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CONTROL-OVERLAY.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-STEP PIC 9 VALUE 1.
01 WS-ACC PIC 9(6) VALUE 100.
01 WS-RAW PIC X(4).
01 WS-VIEW REDEFINES WS-RAW.
   05 WS-A PIC 9(2).
   05 WS-B PIC 9(2).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LOGIC.
    GO TO P-CHOOSER.
P-CHOOSER.
    GO TO P-ONE P-TWO DEPENDING ON WS-STEP.
    DISPLAY "FALLTHROUGH".
P-ONE.
    ALTER P-X TO PROCEED TO P-Y.
    GO TO P-X.
P-TWO.
    DISPLAY "BAD-STEP".
    STOP RUN.
P-X.
    GO TO P-ONE.
P-Y.
    MOVE "1234" TO WS-RAW.
    ADD WS-A WS-B TO WS-ACC.
    DISPLAY WS-ACC.
    STOP RUN.
